  "prefLabel": "Plc 2001.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2001.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement RSA 326-N relative to regulating community health workers (CHWs) who seek voluntary certification, by establishing requirements for:\n\n(a) Obtaining and renewing a certificate to practice as a community health worker (CHW) in New Hampshire;\n\n(b) Obtaining certification as a CHW after expiration, lapse, suspension, or revocation of certification; and\n\n(c) Regulating the practice of certified CHWs, including ethical and professional standards required to be met by certificants.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
}
